WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:01.560
- On Sunday night, Taylor Swift

00:00:01.560 --> 00:00:03.390
debuted her music video for Delicate

00:00:03.390 --> 00:00:05.340
at the iHeartRadio Music Awards.

00:00:05.340 --> 00:00:06.840
I would have preferred a music video

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:08.410
for Dancing With Our Hands Tied,

00:00:08.410 --> 00:00:09.831
but Delicate will have to do.

00:00:09.831 --> 00:00:11.125
(wooshing)

00:00:11.125 --> 00:00:12.524
(squeaking)

00:00:12.524 --> 00:00:14.810
(light music)

00:00:14.810 --> 00:00:16.410
Because Taylor Swift is Taylor Swift,

00:00:16.410 --> 00:00:17.900
and the internet is the internet,

00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:20.750
it didn't take long before
fans started finding

00:00:20.750 --> 00:00:22.700
or maybe making up Easter eggs.

00:00:22.700 --> 00:00:24.890
A few eagle eyed viewers
spotted a reference hidden

00:00:24.890 --> 00:00:26.310
in the subway sequence.

00:00:26.310 --> 00:00:28.130
It said track five on the pillar.

00:00:28.130 --> 00:00:30.570
The song is the fifth track on Reputation.

00:00:30.570 --> 00:00:32.570
A lot of fans pointed out
the clear reference to

00:00:32.570 --> 00:00:35.660
Singing in the Rain, while
others called out the music video

00:00:35.660 --> 00:00:38.570
for potentially ripping
off this perfume ad.

00:00:38.570 --> 00:00:40.850
And literally just one person

00:00:40.850 --> 00:00:42.410
has pointed out the similarities to the

00:00:42.410 --> 00:00:45.130
1960 Italian Film L'Avventura.

00:00:45.130 --> 00:00:47.500
But perhaps the most obvious references

00:00:47.500 --> 00:00:49.910
are to her British boyfriend Joe Allen.

00:00:49.910 --> 00:00:51.942
For example, the song has lyrics like,

00:00:51.942 --> 00:00:55.410
"Oh damn, never seen that blue color."

00:00:55.410 --> 00:00:58.290
And you guessed it, Joe has blue eyes.

00:00:58.290 --> 00:00:59.230
Queen of metaphors.

00:00:59.230 --> 00:01:00.950
Other references area
little bit more subtle.

00:01:00.950 --> 00:01:02.270
Like the one seen here.

00:01:02.270 --> 00:01:03.350
Way in the background,

00:01:03.350 --> 00:01:05.330
you can see a sign for Joe's Deli.

00:01:05.330 --> 00:01:06.724
And Twitter user, taylors_cookies,

00:01:06.724 --> 00:01:08.910
cute Twitter name TBH,

00:01:08.910 --> 00:01:11.029
points out that Swift spells out J-O-E

00:01:11.029 --> 00:01:12.810
while she dances.

00:01:12.810 --> 00:01:14.010
Though if you play out the video,

00:01:14.010 --> 00:01:17.082
there are a few other letters
that taylors_cookies left out,

00:01:17.082 --> 00:01:19.440
so unless Taylor was trying to right out

00:01:19.440 --> 00:01:23.610
L-J-O-T-E, this theory
might just be a coincidence.

00:01:23.610 --> 00:01:25.070
Sorry taylors_cookies.

00:01:25.070 --> 00:01:27.810
Other connections are a
little bit harder to deny.

00:01:27.810 --> 00:01:30.260
The Washington Post
speculates that Delicate

00:01:30.260 --> 00:01:33.540
is the answer to the question
where has Taylor been.

00:01:33.540 --> 00:01:35.924
Hence, why she becomes invisible
at the start of the video.

00:01:35.924 --> 00:01:38.240
On the red carpet, someone slipped her

00:01:38.240 --> 00:01:40.612
a glittery note which
the lyrics tell us read,

00:01:40.612 --> 00:01:43.097
"Dive bar on the east side.

00:01:43.097 --> 00:01:44.130
"Where you at?"

00:01:44.130 --> 00:01:45.770
Twitter use, Reagan Dorton,

00:01:45.770 --> 00:01:47.673
and a number of other fans speculate that

00:01:47.673 --> 00:01:50.260
Joe is the one who hands her the note.

00:01:50.260 --> 00:01:51.890
And I speculate that Taylor Swift

00:01:51.890 --> 00:01:53.490
has never been to a dive bar.

00:01:53.490 --> 00:01:56.690
After Taylor reads the
note, poof, she's invisible.

00:01:56.690 --> 00:01:58.210
She's only seen at the end of the video

00:01:58.210 --> 00:02:00.360
by people we guess are her friends.

00:02:00.360 --> 00:02:02.670
It's not a far stretch to imagine that

00:02:02.670 --> 00:02:04.340
Taylor's message in this video is that

00:02:04.340 --> 00:02:06.070
she wants to retreat from the public eye

00:02:06.070 --> 00:02:08.480
and enjoy her relationships in secret.

00:02:08.480 --> 00:02:10.700
Or maybe she just really loves that movie

00:02:10.700 --> 00:02:12.480
Hollow Man starring Kevin Bacon.

00:02:12.480 --> 00:02:13.460
Who's to say?

00:02:13.460 --> 00:02:16.110
I'm sure just starting
to scratch the surface

00:02:16.110 --> 00:02:17.590
of all the little hidden details

00:02:17.590 --> 00:02:19.726
that are hidden in the video.

00:02:19.726 --> 00:02:21.292
But it just goes to show you that

00:02:21.292 --> 00:02:23.170
whenever Taylor Swift
posts anything anywhere,

00:02:23.170 --> 00:02:24.966
the entire world is watching.

00:02:24.966 --> 00:02:26.820
Some,

00:02:26.820 --> 00:02:28.904
more intently than others.

00:02:28.904 --> 00:02:31.987
(mellow happy music)

00:02:39.503 --> 00:02:40.777
(wooshing)

00:02:40.777 --> 00:02:41.689
(squeaking)

